  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "14466344",
      "title": "Showing a Loading Indicator",
      "lectureOrder": 585,
      "videoOrder": 538,
      "sourceHash": "43b4c1d7b4d572162bdcbd363c75ade9e7b9ecc065785993ea180d6d4f570f01",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.875,
          "end": 4.44,
          "en": "Instructor: We're now outputting our loaded posts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.44,
          "end": 6.33,
          "en": "We can re fetch them here by clicking fetch,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.33,
          "end": 8.67,
          "en": "though we of course don't really see a difference here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.67,
          "end": 10.71,
          "en": "because we fetched the same posts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.71,
          "end": 12.06,
          "en": "and we have no indicator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.06,
          "end": 15.69,
          "en": "for whether a request is currently on its way or not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.69,
          "end": 17.82,
          "en": "whilst we're waiting for a response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.82,
          "end": 20.28,
          "en": "Would be nice to have such an indicator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.28,
          "end": 23.64,
          "en": "and that can be easily implemented by adding a new property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.64,
          "end": 25.02,
          "en": "which you could name is loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.02,
          "end": 26.64,
          "en": "which initially is false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 26.64,
          "end": 28.41,
          "en": "and you wanna set is loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.41,
          "end": 30.03,
          "en": "or maybe let's name it is fetching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 30.03,
          "end": 32.52,
          "en": "because I only want to use it for fetching posts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 32.52,
          "end": 33.9,
          "en": "And you can use is fetching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 33.9,
          "end": 36.57,
          "en": "and set it to true whenever you start fetching posts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 36.57,
          "end": 39.48,
          "en": "So here at the beginning of this fetch posts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 39.48,
          "end": 41.94,
          "en": "there you can set this is fetching to true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 41.94,
          "end": 44.19,
          "en": "because now we are starting to fetch posts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 44.19,
          "end": 45.45,
          "en": "and once we're done,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 45.45,
          "end": 47.58,
          "en": "so here in the subscribe function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 47.58,
          "end": 50.79,
          "en": "we can set this is fetching back to false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 50.79,
          "end": 52.77,
          "en": "Now what's the advantage of this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 52.77,
          "end": 54.84,
          "en": "Well, we can show a loading indicator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 54.84,
          "end": 56.88,
          "en": "whilst we're fetching posts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 56.88,
          "end": 58.6,
          "en": "So back here in our template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 59.49,
          "end": 63.51,
          "en": "we wanna show no posts available if we have no posts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 63.51,
          "end": 67.2,
          "en": "and also important if we're not currently fetching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 67.2,
          "end": 68.467,
          "en": "because if we are fetching posts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 68.467,
          "end": 70.59,
          "en": "then we wanna wait for that result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 70.59,
          "end": 74.43,
          "en": "and not show no posts available too early.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 74.43,
          "end": 76.71000000000001,
          "en": "Of course we also only want to output posts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 76.71000000000001,
          "end": 78.69,
          "en": "if we're currently not fetching too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 78.69,
          "end": 81.6,
          "en": "So here I also will output this only",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 81.6,
          "end": 84.42,
          "en": "if we have posts and we're not fetching.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 84.42,
          "end": 87.53999999999999,
          "en": "This of course means we have a third scenario now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 87.53999999999999,
          "end": 89.46000000000001,
          "en": "that we are fetching and we don't care",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 89.46000000000001,
          "end": 91.56,
          "en": "about whether we have posts or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 91.56,
          "end": 94.44,
          "en": "And for this you could output simply loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 94.44,
          "end": 98.52000000000001,
          "en": "or display a nice CSS spinner if you wanted to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 98.52000000000001,
          "end": 103.14,
          "en": "by using \"ngIf=isFetching\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 103.14,
          "end": 104.7,
          "en": "Now let's have a look at that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 104.7,
          "end": 106.74000000000001,
          "en": "Let's reload and you see loading here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 106.74000000000001,
          "end": 109.28999999999999,
          "en": "and if I click fetch post again, you see loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 109.28999999999999,
          "end": 111.50999999999999,
          "en": "Now, unfortunately, kind of,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 111.50999999999999,
          "end": 113.13,
          "en": "Firebase is really fast,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 113.13,
          "end": 116.22,
          "en": "and therefore you only see this for a fraction of a second,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 116.22,
          "end": 117.75,
          "en": "but you see it does work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 117.75,
          "end": 119.46000000000001,
          "en": "And if you had a slower server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 119.46000000000001,
          "end": 121.46,
          "en": "you would of course see it a bit longer.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
